  "description": "Cryogen-free micro-manipulated probe stations for wafers up to 51 mm (2 in). CRX-VF adds a ±2.5 T vertical-field superconducting solenoid (10-420 K); CRX-4K is the lowest-temperature cryogen-free station (4.5 K base, 5-350 K, up to 675 K with the PS-HTSTAGE option). Both use a 2-stage CCR rated 1 W at 4.2 K, up to 6 probe arms (DC/RF, microwave to 67 GHz, fibre optic), a single top viewport (63.5 mm fused quartz chamber window, 50 mm IR-absorbing shield window), <1 um vibration at the sample.",
